{"name":"Firebug","hex":"#cd5c51","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"firebug","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Pyrrhocoris apterus, a common red and black insect, that is the type species of the family Pyrrhocoridae.","A pyromaniac or arsonist."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/firebug"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pyrrhocoris apterus","blocks":[{"text":"The firebug, Pyrrhocoris apterus, is a common insect of the family Pyrrhocoridae. Easily recognisable due to its striking red and black coloration, it may be confused with the similarly coloured though unrelated Corizus hyoscyami. Pyrrhocoris apterus is distributed throughout the Palaearctic from the Atlantic coast of Europe to northwest China. Beyond its native Palaearctic range, it has been recorded in the United States, Central America, Southern Ontario, India, and Australia. It has been reported as recently expanding its distribution northwards into mainland United Kingdom and eastward on to the coast of the Mediterranean Sea. It is frequently observed to form aggregations, especially in immature forms, containing tens to perhaps a hundred individuals."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Firebug.jpg/330px-Firebug.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyrrhocoris_apterus"},{"title":"Firebug (software)","blocks":[{"text":"Firebug is a discontinued free and open-source web browser extension for Mozilla Firefox that facilitated the live debugging, editing, and monitoring of any website's CSS, HTML, DOM, XHR, and JavaScript."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Firebug_extension_screenshot.png/330px-Firebug_extension_screenshot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firebug_(software)"},{"title":"Firebug (comics)","blocks":[{"text":"Firebug is the name of three supervillains appearing in media published by DC Comics, primarily as enemies of Batman. All three are insect-themed arsonists, similar to Firefly."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firebug_(comics)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Pyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG/120px-Pyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Pyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG/250px-Pyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Pyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG/120px-Pyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APyrrhocoridae_-_Pyrrhocoris_apterus-1.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Pyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg/120px-Pyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Pyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg/250px-Pyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Pyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg/120px-Pyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APyrrhocoris_apterus_nymph_vs.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Pyrrhocoris_apterus_group.jpg/120px-Pyrrhocoris_apterus_group.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Pyrrhocoris_apterus_group.jpg/250p